# t3codereversed miniapp sections — synthetic emd page-host corpus

The t3codereversed miniapp's rendered sections (chapter-buttons,
chapter-inputs, chapter-badges — `~/git/t3codereversed/miniapp`, MIT) define
the section SHAPES this corpus exercises. The DATA here is fully synthetic:
every value, label-with-numbers, and source reference is invented for the
fixture (no real measurement ships in this repo). The page mirrors the
"section = card of widgets" pattern the miniapp renders, expressed in the
typed emd component vocabulary a ydesign host paints.

```emd
{"version":1,"kind":"grid","spec":{"columns":2,"gap_px":12,"children":[
